  (text "PA0=ADC1_INP0 analog only. Read VREFINT/calibration; use long sample time and settled bounded samples.\n330k/330k divider +100k output bias: nominal Vadc/Vbat=100/530 when U28 is on.\nReservoir is upstream of U28. NRST low disconnects ADC; powered-off path must not backfeed main rail.\nVoltage/charging is not a fuel gauge; no precise percentage without qualified pack curve.\nNo raw ADC/high-rate power telemetry to host; no sampling/return during private cryptography.\nStatus never renews PIN leases. Internal VBAT charger must stay disabled. Power ramps/leakage NOT tested."
    (at 195 255 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1)
      )
    )
    (uuid "54d46680-d309-5297-bf3e-6bb9934b9512")
  )
)
